# Social UI (shiori.cloud)

## Surfaces

- Use `SOCIAL_SURFACE_CLASS` and `SOCIAL_DIVIDER_CLASS` from `src/components/profile/social/socialUi.ts` for list cards and grouped rows (not `MyListCompactCard` on social surfaces).
- Inner padded blocks (composers, comment cards): `SOCIAL_INSET_SHELL_CLASS`.

## Components

- Avatars: `SocialUserAvatar` (sizes `sm` | `md` | `lg`).
- User rows / search / follow lists: `SocialUserRow`, `SocialSuggestionCard`, `SocialListSkeleton`.
- Feed and comment activity: `SocialActivityCard`, `SocialCommentActivityCard` — same header + poster layout; link anime via `AnimePrefetchLink` when applicable.
- Section headers: `SocialSection` (title + optional description).

## Feed metadata

- New feed `type` values need entries in `socialFeedMeta.tsx` (label, icon, pill colors) and API + `SocialProfileFeedItem` union in `services/socialProfile.ts`.

## Copy

- User-facing Persian; benefit language in release notes, not engineering detail.
- Relative time: `formatRelativeTimeFa` for social/comment headers unless a fixed datetime is required.

## Notifications

- In-app kinds include `social_follow`, `comment_reply`. New social kinds should respect a `notify_*` preference on `telegram_users` and block/mute checks before insert.
